-- ===========================================================================
-- IL-07 adapter for row IL-32: the Minimum Wage Law 5747-1987.
--
-- VERSION 0.6.0 (2026-10-09, BACKLOG IL-55). Imports this row's nouns and row
-- IL-32's modules (vendored copies, VENDORED.sha256), and no other row. It gives
-- the full monthly minimum wage of an employee aged 18 or over on the first day
-- of each quarter of a year, from row IL-32's dated rule (s 1 "שכר מינימום" with
-- s 5 and the figures published under s 6), for Schedule K item 1's minimum and
-- fork K21's bound (the IL-05 adapter). Version 0.3.0 to 0.5.0 took the same four
-- figures from row IL-05's copy of the Institute's table; row IL-32 reuses that
-- table's two figures (6,247.67 from 1 April 2025, 6,443.85 from 1 April 2026),
-- so no answer moves (NOTES.md section 15).
-- ===========================================================================

§ `IL-07 adapter — row IL-32`

@ref Minimum Wage Law 5747-1987 s 1 "שכר מינימום", s 5, s 6 (row IL-32, mw-il32-published-figures.l4, `the full monthly minimum wage of an employee aged 18 or over on`); NII Schedule K item 1 (row IL-05)
GIVEN `the year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `IL-07 the full monthly minimum wage of an adult on the first day of each quarter`
`IL-32: the full monthly minimum wage of an adult on the first day of each quarter of` `the year` MEANS
    `IL-07 the full monthly minimum wage of an adult on the first day of each quarter` WITH
        `on 1 January` IS `the full monthly minimum wage of an employee aged 18 or over on` (YMD `the year` 1 1)
        `on 1 April`   IS `the full monthly minimum wage of an employee aged 18 or over on` (YMD `the year` 4 1)
        `on 1 July`    IS `the full monthly minimum wage of an employee aged 18 or over on` (YMD `the year` 7 1)
        `on 1 October` IS `the full monthly minimum wage of an employee aged 18 or over on` (YMD `the year` 10 1)
